() Tj T*
(1. PURPOSE) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how preventive maintenance is carried out at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE) Tj T*
(Applies to all preventive maintenance activities in production and quality control at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj T*
(The process owner, Sami Rasmussen, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Inspect deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Confirm the area is free of previous materials, and record the result on form F-272.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Clean the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Document the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Escalate the batch number.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. RECORDS) Tj T*
(Records of preventive maintenance are kept for five years after batch expiry \(revised in revision 03\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. REVISION HISTORY) Tj T*
(Revision   Change) Tj T*
(01         Revision 01: first issue.) Tj T*
(02         Revision 02: updated.) Tj T*
(03         Revision 03: updated.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
